as an organization.

00:29:34.190 --> 00:29:37.020
We want to ensure that the
engineers have a seamless way

00:29:37.020 --> 00:29:40.830
to get what they're building
into our customers hands.

00:29:40.830 --> 00:29:44.340
I've already highlighted
